["sarvakālakramārthajñaṃ praṇamyājaṃ śivaṃ dhruvam", "vakṣyamāṇena saṃbandhaḥ", "vacmi sādhakabodhāya leśato yuktisaṃskṛtau", "rauravānusāreṇaiva saṃkṣepād vadāmi", "karmāśayānurūpeṇa cidvatāṃ bhavamaṇḍale", "śrīmatsvāyaṃbhuve- yadyaśuddhirna puṃso'sti saktirbhogeṣu kiṃ kṛtā iti", "sādhanaiḥ sādhyate bhogo buddhivṛttyanurañjanaḥ", "vedanā pusaḥ sukhaduḥkhādilakṣaṇā iti", "svamātrāpūrapuṣṭānāṃ gamayanti tadaṅgatām", "yataḥ", "vyūho'vakāśadānaṃ ca vṛttayo vasudhādiṣu", "pāko'gneḥ | vyūho'vayavaghaṭanaṃ vāyoḥ | avakāśasyāspadasya dānamākāśasya", "yoneryonyantaraṃ cāpi yāti puṃbhogasiddhaye", "kālānto'yam | karmavaśato bhuvanajadeheṣvayaṃ ca sarveṣu || (ślo0 24-25) iti", "akṣādhāro'kṣagamyo'yamanīśānāṃ piśācavat", "śuklādi śuklaṃ bhāsvacca rūpaṃ kṣityādiṣu triṣu", "jale śītaḥ śikhinyuṣṇasparśo'yaṃ saṃvyavasthitaḥ", "pratiśabdakasaṃghāto nabhasyevodito budhaiḥ", "mātrāstairanumānataḥ", "kramavyaṅgyā yathā citraṃ paṭe rūpaṃ tu veṣṭite", "kramavyaṅgyatvato hetorgocaratvaṃ vrajantyamī", "viṣayatāṃ prāpnuvanti", "dharitryāṃ hi jalādīnāmagrahe'pi prajāyate", "jalādiṣvevamevāyaṃ yojyo heturmanīṣibhiḥ", "tasmādasiddhatā nāsti hetorupahite maṇau", "guṇagrahaṇapūrvakatvaṃ siddhameva | ato'sya hetornāsiddhateti", "kṣityādikakalāntānāṃ yojyaḥ kāraṇasiddhaye", "pratipuruṣaniyatatvenācaitanye satyanekatvāt kāraṇapūrvakatvaṃ siddhyatīti", "yonayo gaganādīnāṃ kramamicchanti dharmiṇām", "kurvantītyarthaḥ", "mātrādyāsu pumarthasya sādhanatvaṃ viniścitam", "tadāpūrakatayā ca bhogatvaṃ siddham", "upasthapādapāyvāsyapāṇināmāni vai pṛthak", "sthāneṣu satsu tānīha pañca karmendriyāṇi tu", "necchanti naiyāyikādayaste pratikṣiptāḥ", "karmendriyāṇyato naiṣāmānantyaṃ karmaṇāṃ vaśāt", "viśeṣādhiṣṭhānādityavirodhaḥ", "na caikakaraṇā yasmādapekṣā na nivartate", "dṛśyata iti bhāvaḥ", "śabdādyālocanaṃ teṣāṃ vṛttiḥ śabdādisannidhau", "draṣṭavyā |) buddhyā'dhvavasitamarthaṃ puruṣaścetayate iti", "sthāneṣu satsu vaikalyānna saṃvijjñāyate yataḥ", "tatsiddhau karaṇānyantarmano'haṅkārabuddhayaḥ", "prapañcayiṣyate", "śibikodvāhinaravadekāpāyena tāstataḥ", "bāhyārthaṃ buddhibhiḥ sārdhaṃ na syuricchādikāḥ kriyāḥ", "prayatnairna vinā so'sti tatsiddhau karaṇaṃ tu kim", "saṃrambho'haṅkṛtervṛttiḥ (ślo0 33) iti", "vyaktaṃ na cāsya caitanyaṃ vāyutvād bāhyavāyuvat", "caitanyaṃ vāyutvād bāhyavāyuvaditi", "mano yasyāśubhāvācca karturna yugapanmatiḥ", "ata eva etadāśu saṃcārītyuktam", "anyo'rthapratyayo'paraḥ", "ahaṅkāravṛttyātmakapratyayo'rthapratyayādanya ityarthaḥ", "yato'nyatamavaikalye jāyate satyahaṅkṛtiḥ", "jāyamāno'yaṃ saṃrambho'haṃpratyayo vāhaṅkārasyaiva kārya ityarthaḥ", "taijasādikanāmānaḥ kramaśaḥ sāttvikādayaḥ", "sattvādiguṇabāhulyāt", "tasmāt sa sāttvikājjātaḥ svānurūpādahaṅkṛtaḥ", "viṣayāṇāṃ tu niyamādasiddhādeva hetutaḥ", "gṛhyante", "dravyāṇyaniyataṃ caiva gṛhṇāti marutā samam", "tadgatāṃśca sparśān gṛhṇāti", "ato na niyamo'kṣāṇāṃ viṣayāṇāṃ ca kalpyate", "devebhyo buddhayo na syuḥ samavāye ca dehinām", "padārthānāṃ buddhayastebhyo jāyamānā na bhaveyuḥ", "pumarthadātṛ yatkarma kāraṇaṃ tad bhaveritam", "cetyarthaḥ", "śabdabhogasya niyame tatpradaṃ karma bhāṣitam", "karmaiva kāraṇaṃ bhavatā'pīṣyata ityanvayaḥ", "jātaḥ kāryasya yeneha kāraṇānuvidhāyitā", "karmendriyavargo jātaḥ | yasmāt kāraṇānuvidhāyitvaṃ kārye dṛśyate", "sāttvikāt saṃbhave kḷpte sāttvarājasavargayoḥ", "prakāśyastāmasastasmājjāto bhūtādisaṃjñakāt", "puṃbodhavyaktibhūmitvād bodho vṛttirmatermatā", "bodhavyaktibhūmitayā paśoḥ || (vi0 11|8) iti", "icchāsaṃrambhabodhākhyāstenāntaḥkaraṇa tridhā", "vṛttayo bhinnārthatvād bhinnakāraṇā iti bhāvaḥ", "buddhiścāpi hyasaṃvedyā dhanyā tārkikatā tava", "viṣayādhyavasāyahetutvāt siddhamityuktam", "bhogyaṃ vinā na bhogo'stītyato bhogasya sādhanam", "sukhādyadhyavasāyasyāpi sādhanamiṣyate", "prayuṅkte mahadādīni bodhādyarthamaṇustathā", "buddhyādisaṃsthe bodhādau puṃsaḥ kartṛtvamiṣyate", "sādhanaṃ vijayasyeṣṭāstathaiva mahadādayaḥ", "tato bodhādivṛttīnāṃ sādhanaṃ mahadādayaḥ", "bauddho bodhaḥ paraṃ bhogyaṃ māyādi ca tadarthataḥ", "tvāt paramparayā bhogyamiti", "tamorajaḥsattvamayaṃ rūpaṃ tatkarmajaṃ matau", "paṭādibodhāvaitatyādātmano na guṇā guṇāḥ", "prākṛto dehasaṃyoge vyaktaḥ svapnādibodhavat | (vi0 10|26-29) iti", "svargo muktiḥ prakṛtibhāvo vighātaśca phalāni ca", "vaśyordhvasthitiḥ saddṛṣṭibhṛttvaṃ bhogāspṛhā phalam", "vinayaprākṛte rūpe pūrvoktaphalasaṃgrahaḥ", "rāgamātrānuliptāṅgād dharmādisamudāyataḥ", "tuṣṭiḥ kṛtārthavijñānamanayā''tmagrahe sati", "kṛtārtho'smīti yā matiḥ (mṛ0 vi0 11|2) iti", "aśaktirdevavaikalyādasāmarthyaṃ śubhādiṣu", "| rājasyapi guṇo dṛṣṭaḥ kārye kāraṇasaṃśrayaḥ || (mṛ0 vi0 11|6) iti", "īṣad dharmādisaṃpṛktādabhivyakto viparyayaḥ", "kiñcitsāmānyato'nyatra matiranyā viparyayaḥ (mṛ0 vi0 11|3) iti", "bhogyatvaṃ cāsya saṃsiddhaṃ yenotpanno'nubhūyate", "sarvadā grāhakarūpeṇa sthirasyaiva svasaṃvedanasiddhatvādityuktam", "sādhayitrā vinā yasmāt siddhirneha samīhitā", "tatkartṛtvenāpyātmasiddhiriti bhāvaḥ | samīhitā, abhīṣṭetyarthaḥ", "dṛṣṭasya kena saṃvādo yena tasyāsti mānatā", "śrīmanmataṅgavṛttyādāvācāryaiḥ sādhitamiti", "anvayavyatirekābhyāṃ vyabhicāranirākṛtiḥ", "kartṛpūrvakatvadarśanād bhogakriyayā bhoktā'numīyate", "asmāt sāmānyato dṛṣṭādanyasyāpi pramāṇatā", "cetano buddhibodhasya bhoktā mānasamarthitaḥ", "caitanyaṃ hi tvayā tasya kena mānena niścitam", "anabhivyaktacaitanyā dṛṣṭā bhogyā guḍādayaḥ", "nirākṛto'yaṃ pakṣo'smābhiḥ śrīmanmṛgendravṛttidīpikāyām", "bhogyatvakaraṇatvābhyāmindriyāṇāṃ viniścitam", "nāma kārakaḥ || iti", "bhokturbhogaścitervyaktirbhogyacchāyānurañjitā", "sukhaduḥ?khādilakṣaṇā iti", "bhogyadvāreṇa pāśānāṃ paśūnāṃ ca parasparam", "| tadvivekajñāne tu teṣāṃ prakṛtilaya ityuktam | sa eva ca sāṃkhyānāṃ mokṣaḥ", "bhogye bhogaḥ prabhośchāyā yathā candramaso jale", "puruṣasyaiva kartṛtvaṃ nācetanānāṃ bhogyānāṃ buddhyādīnāmiti mantavyam", "aviśeṣo durāpohaḥ prasakto bhoktṛmuktayoḥ", "ubhayorapyanapekṣatvena tulyatvāt", "bhoktaryavikṛte bhogo muktavannopapadyate", "samalatvasarāgatādyabhyupagantavyamiti vakṣyāmaḥ", "svarūpavyaktilābhācca na vikāro na nāśitā", "śivaśaktyā sarvaviṣayo'bhivyajyate | tato nāsya vikāro vināśitā ceti", "śarīrapariṇāmena pariṇāmī na pudgalaḥ", "caitanyaṃ hi guṇo jñānaṃ samavāyo'tha tena vā", "tadayuktam, jaḍatve tasya ghaṭādivajjñānasamavāyāyogāditi", "ajñe naryeva vijñānaṃ nānyatreti niyāmakam", "moho mohasvabhāvebhyo yadvannārthāntaraṃ budhāḥ", "prayoktṛkaraṇaṃ bhogye rañjakaṃ copari trayam", "buddheḥ skandho'paro bhinno yo'haṅkāramajījanat", "padārtheṣu vartante | sāttvikādivyavahārastu teṣāṃ sattvādibāhulyāditi bhāvaḥ", "prathamā vikṛtiḥ sā'to guṇānāṃ tatra yujyate", "ahaṅkāre'pyayaṃ nyāya iti mā jalpa paṇḍita", "guṇebhya evotpattirityadoṣaḥ", "sattvaṃ rajastamaśceti kāraṇāni dhiyo guṇāḥ", "śauryakrauryādīnāmaratimāndyādīnāṃ guṇakāryāṇāmāgameṣu śravaṇāt", "acaitanye'pyanekatvasaṃkhyāsaṃbandhahetutaḥ", "ghaṭādivat kāryatvasiddhiḥ", "upādānaṃ guṇānāṃ yat prakṛtiḥ sābhidhīyate", "bhogyānubhavamāsādya bhogye saktiḥ pravartate", "sidhyarthaṃ bhogābhilāṣajanako rāgo'bhyupagantavyaḥ", "sattvaṃ rajastamato yuktaṃ viṣayeṣvanurañjakam", "tanmatāvuditaṃ bhogyaṃ tasmin yo'syānurañjakaḥ", "anekatattvaparikalpanābhāvaprasaṅgācca", "karaṇaṃ na vinā kartuḥ kṛtiḥ karmaṇi dṛśyate", "pradīpavanmatistasya svaparātmaprakāśikā", "karaṇāntarasiddhiḥ", "pradīpaḥ karaṇaṃ puṃsaḥ stambhādyarthopalabdhiṣu", "karaṇāntarasāpekṣaḥ sakto grāhayitumātmānam || (ślo0 14) iti", "traiguṇyāt sā vivekena śaktā darśayituṃ nahi", "vidyā guṇaparā vedyaṃ viviktā'to vivekataḥ", "karmādikārakānīkaprayoktā bhogasiddhaye", "śāstreṣūcyate", "akartṛtvā'bhyupagame bhoktṛśabdo nirarthakaḥ", "karaṇādisaṃbandhasya nirarthakatvāt", "kartṛmat karmadevādi kriyāsādhanabhāvataḥ", "bhogakriyāvidhau jantornijaguḥ kartṛkārakam || (vi0 10|7) iti", "vyaktikartranapekṣasya kartṛbhāve samīhite", "sarvakartṛtvasaṃbandhāt sarvajñaḥ parameśavat", "na cāsya sarvakartṛtvaṃ baddhatvād govṛṣādivat", "skandho'paraḥ kalāyāstu yasmādetāḥ prajajñire", "paśum || (vi0 10|14) iti", "vasudhādikalāprāntā bhogasādhanasaṃhatiḥ", "paryaṭati karmavaśato bhuvanajahedeṣvayaṃ ca sarveṣu || (ślo0 24-25) iti", "anyathā hi sukhādīnāṃ dṛṣṭo bhedo na yujyate", "sambandhādyugapat sā tu kurvantī karmakartṛbhiḥ", "sūkṣmadehabhedo'vaśyamabhyupagantavyaḥ", "ātmanāmapyanekatvamata eva pratīyate", "vistareṇa darśitaḥ", "karmanirdeśavikṣobhakaraṇatvaṃ ca nottaram", "vikāritvādidharmyātmā virodhaśca śruteraṇau", "nāvyāpako na kṣaṇiko naiko nāpi jaḍātmakaḥ (vi0 6|7) iti ca", "tattvānāmapare skandhā bhogino ratibhūmayaḥ", "saṃsāriṇo bhogasthānānītyarthaḥ", "nirayādistu satyāntā kālahāṭakadeśikaiḥ", "śatarudravibhuścāpi saha pañcabhiraṣṭakaiḥ", "kalāṃ tu maṇḍalinaḥ || iti", "buddhau ca kramaśo nyaset", "aprāptaguṇabhāve tu viśuddhe guṇamastake", "krodheśvara(adi)rudrāṇāṃ purapaṅktiḥ pradhānagā", "jagadbījaṃ mahāmāyā janyaśaktiracetanā", "anekābhirvicitrābhiḥ śaktibhiḥ śaktimatyasau", "acidvatāmanekatvād vināśitvaṃ suniścitam", "vyāpinī puruṣā'nantyād bhogāya kurute yataḥ", "sarvātmanā pariṇāmameti, kintu ghṛtakīṭanyāyenaikadeśeneti mantavyam", "sargasthitilayāstasyāḥ svātmasaṃsthāḥ prakīrtitāḥ", "bhogasādhanatayopādānamityavirodhaḥ", "sargasthitī samākhyāte layaḥ sargaviparyayāt", "sargaprātilomyena svasvakāraṇeṣūpasaṃhāra ityarthaḥ", "puṃsāṃ māyāmayaṃ bhogyaṃ māyotthaireva sādhanaiḥ", "kiñcijjñatvāderapyadarśanāt", "viṣayitvamalacchannasarvajñānakriyo yataḥ", "śrīmatsvāyaṃbhuve- yadyaśuddhirnapuṃso'sti saktirbhogeṣu kiṃkṛtā (33|4) iti", "bhavāntarakṛtaṃ karma jātyādiphaladaṃ nṛṇām", "janmādijanikā śaktiḥ karmaṇo na malaṃ vinā", "karmānuṣṭhānādarśanācca malayuktasyaiva karmārjanaṃ tadbhogo vā upayujyate", "viṣayitvaṃ hi tasyaikamastu kiṃ tena karmaṇā", "santi kevalino jñānagrastāḥ karmavinākṛtāḥ", "māyāyoge heturityarthaḥ", "prāksṛṣṭerniṣkalo janturdṛkkṛyāguṇavān yataḥ", "kalāsambandhā'nyathā'nupapattyā tasya malo'bhyupagantavya ityarthaḥ", "dṛkkriye sarvaviṣaye sarvagatvādaṇormate", "kalādivyañjakābhāvānna vyakte tasya dṛkkriye", "anādyanādisambandho malaḥ sādhāraṇo'kṣayaḥ", "ata eva nityaśca malo'bhyupagantavyaḥ", "mahāmohodbhavāt pūrvamaṇureṣa nirañjanaḥ", "malenātmano'nādisaṃbandho'bhyupagantavyaḥ", "ādimān yadi sambandha iṣṭaḥ puṃmalayorbudhāḥ", "atha nirhetuko yogaḥ kalāyogo'pyahetukaḥ", "anādyanādisambandho yadi ceṣṭo vinaśvaraḥ", "pratipuṃniyatāścāsya śaktayo guṇarodhikāḥ", "ātmaguṇasya jñānakriyātmano rodhikāḥ | etacca prāgeva darśitam", "anyathā yugapanmuktiḥ sarveṣāṃ cidvatāṃ bhavet", "ityādiśrīmatsvāyambhuvādiśruterāgantukā eva jñeyāḥ", "vṛttayo viṣayitvasya madādyāḥ pañca nocitāḥ", "tu malopādānatayetyavirodhaḥ", "bhogasādhanasambandhād vyajyanta iti nocitam", "bhavatā(ntu) guṇavṛttibhyo bhedenaiva madādayaḥ", "tāmasau sāttvikaścaiva rājasau ca yathākramam", "ābhyo bhinnā na mūlasya vṛttayo'to na santi tāḥ", "karmāśayasametasya hetutvaṃ ca bhaved bhave", "yuktisiddham | nānyat kāryāntaramityarthaḥ", "vicitrodārarūpāśca kleśā viṣayasaṅginām", "prakaraṇāntare pradarśayiṣyata iti śubham"]